  "relation": "Attained hypergraph Ramsey number: hg_ramsey_number E C R holds when the host I_R forces a monochromatic copy of the pattern E : {set {set T}} under the palette C : Type (D5 hg_forces_mono) and every forcing host size N has R <= N. R is supplied: no existence theorem, choice or minimum extraction; arbitrary carrier, family and palette, no uniformity, nonempty-family, inhabited-palette or positivity guard (empty palette: minimum 0; a colour and the empty family: minimum #|T|). The Extremal graph-arrow Ramsey numbers (X195, X215) are separate interfaces.",
